{
    "background_story": "Kareem was a talented young writer who had just landed his dream job at a prestigious publishing house. However, his excitement was short-lived as he soon found himself working under a demanding editor who consistently belittled his ideas and work. The editor's constant criticism and condescending tone made Kareem feel small and unvalued. Despite his best efforts, Kareem's confidence began to dwindle, and he started to doubt his abilities. The editor's demeaning behavior made Kareem feel like he was walking on eggshells, never knowing when the next verbal blow would come. One day, Kareem realized that he deserved better and decided to stand up for himself, refusing to let the editor's toxic behavior define his self-worth. He eventually left the publishing house and went on to find success and recognition as a writer, free from the shackles of his former boss's demeaning attitude.",
